.DS_Store

.DS_Store
*.code-workspace
__pycache__/

# WiFi credentials never enter this repository.
#
# The WiFi examples read SSID and password from an arduino_secrets.h that you
# create locally; it is ignored here, and .git/hooks/pre-commit refuses any
# commit that tries to add one anyway. arduino_secrets.h.example is the
# tracked template and holds placeholders only.
arduino_secrets.h
**/arduino_secrets.h
